  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1233458/description_d357a738-245d-4bf1-9c7f-170fea3b7098.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"754\" height=\"222\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>ItemZoomer</strong> 是一款轻量级的客户端模组，通过在你鼠标悬停于任何物品时显示<strong>大型放大预览</strong>，提升了你的物品栏体验。它在创造模式、模组物品栏或想要近距离欣赏物品细节时尤为有用！</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>该模组为物品预览提供了多种入场与待机动画：<br><br><span><span><iframe style=\"width:509px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YthxDrKlfaM\" width=\"509\" height=\"298\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>Item Zoomer 的灵感完全来源于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/itemzoom\" rel=\"nofollow\">ItemZoom</a>&nbsp;，并作为其理念上的延续进行开发。<br><br>运行需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a>。</p>\n<hr>\n<p>不兼容项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>VulkanMod</li>\n</ul>",
